

                       New user Information.
                       ---------------------

Well, I guess if you are reading this message, you are a new user !!!
Welcome aboard Rap's BBS, You won't be sorry that you called !!  The program
that the BBS runs on is called MiniBBS. MiniBBS, is written in the Telix Salt
Script language.  Jonathan Rapoport, and Colin Sampaleanu wrote this program,
and encurage you to pass it on.  The program usually takes around 2 min. at
1200 baud.  This program is great as a private BBS, or when your regular BBS
system is down.

I hope you enjoy it !

Se Ya Later







